# Treat binary/media archives as binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.mkv binary
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
